id: agent-circular-ref
language: SQL
severity: error
rule:
  pattern: UPDATE agents SET parent_id = $$$
message: |
  Agent tree update must check for circular references via trigger.
  
  Required BEFORE UPDATE trigger:
  CREATE TRIGGER prevent_circular_ref BEFORE UPDATE ON agents
  FOR EACH ROW
  BEGIN
    SELECT RAISE(ABORT, 'Circular reference detected')
    WHERE EXISTS (
      WITH RECURSIVE path AS (
        SELECT NEW.parent_id AS id
        UNION ALL
        SELECT parent_id FROM agents JOIN path ON agents.id = path.id
      )
      SELECT 1 FROM path WHERE id = NEW.id
    );
  END;
note: |
  Circular references in agent tree cause:
  • Infinite loops during commission calculation
  • Stack overflow in recursive queries
  • Corrupted revenue distribution
  
  The trigger walks up the tree from new parent_id.
  If it encounters NEW.id, the update is aborted.

